          "source_index": 1,
          "kind": "list",
          "level": null,
          "text": "1.  Barbara Smit，Sneaker Wars：The Enemy Brothers Who Founded Adidas and Puma and the Family Feud That Forever Changed the Business of Sports，Ecco / HarperCollins，2008",
